  "description": "<div style=\"font-family:Poppins;\"><div><p class=\"isSelectedEnd\"><strong>About our brand and products:</strong><br>RAHSTRÖM is a Scandinavian jewelry brand focused on timeless, minimalist design and high-quality materials. Our collections are inspired by Nordic aesthetics and modern elegance, offering jewelry that can be worn every day as well as for special occasions. We focus on clean design, durability, and a premium look and feel.</p><p class=\"isSelectedEnd\"><strong>What makes us different:</strong><br>We are a fast-growing direct-to-consumer brand with a strong visual identity and a focus on lifestyle and branding. We work actively with content, social media, and influencers, and we aim to build long-term partnerships with our affiliates, not just short-term promotions.</p><p class=\"isSelectedEnd\"><strong>How affiliates can earn:</strong><br>We offer a competitive commission on every sale generated through your affiliate link or discount code. We are open to higher commission rates for high-performing partners and long-term collaborations.</p><p class=\"isSelectedEnd\"><strong>How to promote us:</strong><br>Affiliates can promote RAHSTRÖM through social media, blogs, websites, email marketing, and content creation such as Instagram, TikTok, and Pinterest. We provide affiliate links, discount codes, and visual materials if needed.</p><p><strong>Other information:</strong><br>We are very open to collaboration ideas and custom campaigns. Our goal is to build strong partnerships where both sides benefit and grow together.</p></div></div>",
